flowchart TD
    A([Attendant selects prescription]) --> B[Begin one database transaction]
    B --> C{Prescription exists?}
    C -- No --> X[Raise not-found error]
    C -- Yes --> D{Status is pending?}
    D -- No --> Y[Reject dispensed/cancelled status]
    D -- Yes --> E[Load all lines and medicine records]
    E --> F{Any controlled medicine?}
    F -- Yes --> G{Prescriber code on allow-list?}
    G -- No --> Z[Reject unauthorised prescriber]
    G -- Yes --> H[Check stock for every line at prescription branch]
    F -- No --> H
    H --> I{All lines sufficiently stocked?}
    I -- No --> J[Raise insufficient-stock error]
    I -- Yes --> K[Conditional stock deductions]
    K --> L{Every update affected expected row?}
    L -- No --> M[Raise concurrency/stock error]
    L -- Yes --> N[Conditional pending-to-dispensed update]
    N --> O{Exactly one prescription row updated?}
    O -- No --> P[Raise invalid/concurrent state error]
    O -- Yes --> Q[Commit transaction]
    Q --> R([Return dispensed prescription])
    X --> S[Rollback transaction]
    Y --> S
    Z --> S
    J --> S
    M --> S
    P --> S
    S --> T([Prescription remains pending; no stock deduction persists])
